domain:ui#2 · os-steve · session_01ADHkmSzhXR4yUAgwq1bQRi

**File surface amendment** · 2026-11-16T02:36Z
Route (a), reading the parent through the related list's own resolver, cannot be taken from `@object-ui/components`. The parent-row read is `BoundRecordProvider`, which is module-private in `plugin-detail/recordBinding.tsx`, and `plugin-detail` depends on `components`, not the reverse. So the card takes route (b), the objectstack#26613 list-count channel with its existing force-mount. Added to the surface:
- `ui/packages/plugin-detail/src/RelatedList.tsx`, which reports the settled total through a package-internal context;
- `ui/packages/plugin-detail/src/relatedListCompact.ts`, which defines that context and does not export it from the index, so there is no new public prop and Clause-② stays no;
- `ui/packages/plugin-detail/src/renderers/record-related-list.tsx`, which provides the reporter only when `parentDataSource` is a binding;
- their tests.

`containers.tsx` stays on the surface.
